.. math:: \sigma^2 = \frac{1}{\max(0,~N - \delta N)}\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}(x_i-\bar{x})^2

where :math:`x` is the sample set of elements, :math:`\bar{x}` is the
sample mean, :math:`N` is the number of samples and :math:`\delta N` is
the :attr:`correction`.



